    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 13:20:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>跟朋友随便聊聊的一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎嘉宾：阿阳！</span></p><span></span><p><span>他！为爱情奔赴内蒙古，遭遇高物价、方言沟通难等职场困境，后毅然辞职创业。他！从 “恋爱脑” 到重寻自我，分享职场生存技巧与情感反思，真实又有料！</span></p><span></span><p><span>--时间轴--</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a>内蒙古生存真相：薪酬体系揭秘 + 鄂尔多斯高物价 “避雷”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>职场规划坑：大公司 “调回西安” 承诺靠谱吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>毕业求职劫：苏州 IT 公司秋招入职即裁员，转赴内蒙古</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>理想 vs 现实：向往 “生活气息” 却陷入内卷麻木</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>专业适配度：大学知识 “纸上谈兵”，课外技能才是地基</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a>AI 与职场：AI 只替代初级编码，高级逻辑不可取代</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a>职场生存术：接手大项目崩溃后，学会反馈 + 抓机遇</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>恋爱观碰撞：INTJvsINFJ “为伴侣改轨迹” 的分歧</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">42:25</a>辞职真相：恋家 + 工作重复，靠人脉找到创业新机会</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">42:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a>创业选择：不惧风险爱挑战，内向者也能练沟通</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a>终极建议：肯吃苦抓机会，影响健康就果断辞职</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
