    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>《庆余年》第二季以范闲真气恢复戛然而止，三大坊的故事还未结束！王倦，第三季能不能快点啊？🥺</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>看完第二季，跟第一季相比还是有很多变化的！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>所以这期就来聊聊，第二季究竟变了哪里？🤔</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>💗嘉宾阵容</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64ad6bfce751898d04ed8ad6"><span>《朋友走慢点》Q老师：见面三分情的情闺~💞</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>💝在这一期我分享了：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> &nbsp;五年啦！第一季讲的啥来着？</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>死的不过是个护卫！</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>二皇子或为真凶？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>都是庆帝安排的！包括爱情</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>肖恩的孙子？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>太子心中的蒙面女人</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> &nbsp;第二季暂排苦思，除去巫山非云也~</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>叶灵儿：换的不过是个配角</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>儋州土包子爆改京都贵公子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>太子：披着羊皮的狼罢了</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> &nbsp;这世上，总要有人装个头破血流！</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>世间多不公，以血引雷霆</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a> &nbsp;世间良将郭宝坤？绝无此种可能！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> &nbsp;一直铺垫的婚礼就这？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> &nbsp;不想跪就不跪？朕等你不得不跪！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> &nbsp;安慕希酸酪，好吃好吃~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> &nbsp;如果长公主不曾爱庆帝，你就是我的姐！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">48:31</a> &nbsp;二皇子和叶灵儿，强行塞糖磕不动！不如跟范闲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> &nbsp;第二季角色盘点：哪些新鲜血液让我们心动？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3646">01:00:46</a> &nbsp;大皇子不愧为武将！馋的我~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4110">01:08:30</a> &nbsp;编剧不是不会写女性！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4322">01:12:02</a> &nbsp;毕业季，祝大家心中有光亮，始终如少年~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎶BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>誠に遺憾ながら、知り合い？+-+高橋邦幸</span></p><span></span><p><span>有生之年-李建</span></p><span></span><p><span>👫👭在这些地方也可以听到我的分享：</span></p><span></span><p><span>QQ音乐|荔枝FM|喜马拉雅|蜻蜓FM|苹果播客|微博音频</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7882559302" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7882559302"><span>苏苏而谈和宬园_播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64d89bd5000000000200c330?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64d89bd5000000000200c330&amp;apptime=1707226555" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64d89bd5000000000200c330?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=64d89bd5000000000200c330&amp;apptime=1707226555"><span>苏苏而谈和宬园</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：</span><a href="https://okjk.co/IlcbfZ" data-url="https://okjk.co/IlcbfZ"><span>是提拉米苏_</span></a></p>]]></description>
